```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as User / Client UI
  participant API as Next.js API Layer
  participant Auth as NextAuth / Session
  participant DB as MongoDB (Mongoose)
  participant Super as KernelSupervisor
  participant Plan as DynamicWorkflowPlanner
  participant Kernel as WorkflowExecutionGraph
  participant Verify as ObjectiveVerificationEngine
  participant Saga as CompensationSagaCoordinator

  Note over User, DB: Phase 1: Startup & Session Hydration
  User->>API: GET /api/dashboard (Bearer JWT)
  API->>Auth: Validate JWT / Session Token
  Auth-->>API: Valid Session (userId: "usr_123")
  API->>DB: Query Tasks, Goals, HealthMetrics, Schedule
  DB-->>API: Return User State Documents
  API-->>User: 200 OK (Aggregated Dashboard JSON)

  Note over User, Saga: Phase 2: Conversational Turn & Execution
  User->>API: POST /api/conversation ("Schedule gym at 5pm and defer reading")
  API->>Auth: Authenticate Request
  API->>DB: Fetch Recent History & Active Goals
  DB-->>API: History Records
  
  API->>Super: dispatchTurn(prompt, context)
  Super->>Plan: plan(goal, availableCapabilities)
  Plan-->>Super: DAG Plan [Step 1: CheckCal, Step 2: MoveReading, Step 3: InsertGym]
  
  Super->>Kernel: executeGraph(DAG)
  
  rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over Kernel, Verify: Step Execution & Verification Loop
    Kernel->>Kernel: Acquire Path Locks (concurrency <= 3)
    Kernel->>DB: Mutate Task & Schedule Documents
    DB-->>Kernel: Mutation Applied
    Kernel->>Verify: verifyOutcome(actionId, expectedState)
    alt Verification Succeeded
      Verify-->>Kernel: Class 1 / Class 2 CONFIRMED
      Kernel->>DB: Append Durable ActionAudit & Trace
    else Verification Failed / Ambiguous
      Verify-->>Kernel: FAILURE_DETECTED
      Kernel->>Saga: executeCompensation(failedAction)
      Saga->>DB: Rollback Previous Graph Actions
      Saga-->>Kernel: Graph Safely Reverted
    end
  end

  Kernel-->>Super: Execution Complete / Result Summary
  Super-->>API: Turn Synthesized Response
  API-->>User: 200 OK (Streamed Markdown Response + UI Updates)

  Note over API, DB: Phase 3: Background & Asynchronous Processing
  participant Hook as External Webhook (Whoop/GCal)
  Hook->>API: POST /api/signals/ingest
  API->>DB: Write Raw TelemetrySignalModel
  Note right of API: Background Daemons (MorningBriefing, ProactiveAgent)<br/>ARE NOT RUNNING AUTOMATICALLY (No Cron Runner)
```

